  <span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hi {{{QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_First_Host_First_Name__c}}},<br /> <br /> We look forward to welcoming you to the Qantas First Lounge tomorrow, ahead of your flight from Sydney to {{{QCC_First_Host__c.Qcc_Arrival_Airport__c}}}.<br /> <br /> We’re pleased to offer you the following services before you fly:<br /> •&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Curb side assistance for your luggage in Sydney with our Porter Service. This can be arranged up until 15 minutes before you arrive at the airport, simply call 0409 711 556 as you approach the terminal.<br /> •&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Any other special requirements you may have prior to or during your flight.<br /> We've captured your arrival time for {{{QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_Expected_Arrival_Time__c}}} for curbside collection.<br /> When you arrive at Sydney International Airport, please proceed to our dedicated First Check-in area which is located at the far end of Counter D in the main check-in hall.<br /> Our Qantas First team look forward to greeting/welcoming you tomorrow.<br /> <br /> Warm regards,<br /> <br /> {{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br /> Customer Relationship Specialist<br /> QANTAS VIP Service Team<br /> World Wide +61 1300 752 801</span></span>
